        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric cargo bicycle production, without battery and motor</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric cargo bicycle production, without battery and motor
 This is a copy of the ecoinvent dataset "electric bicycle production" where the battery and the electric motor have been removed.
Also, the additional weight comes from an increase in steel (20%) and wood (80%), to amount to a vehicle mas sof 50kg in total.
We assume teh cargo box is made of glue laminated spruce timber, with a density of 450 kg/m3.. UUID: af874476-8ae3-32e4-accb-b005abfc0fe7
Location: Unspecified
Technology: This is a copy of the ecoinvent dataset "electric bicycle production" where the battery and the electric motor have been removed.
Also, the additional weight comes from an increase in steel (20%) and wood (80%), to amount to a vehicle mas sof 50kg in total.
We assume teh cargo box is made of glue laminated spruce timber, with a density of 450 kg/m3.
